OL,3,GNEWSAFormer golf course transformed
OL,4,Ainto nature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former golf course on the
OL,7,FLincolnshire coast has been transformed
OL,8,Finto a wetland nature reserve, creating
OL,9,Fan important new habitat for wildlife
OL,10,Fand a destination for visitors.
OL,12,FNational Trust Sandilands, near Sutton
OL,13,Fon Sea, officially opens on Saturday
OL,14,Ffollowing a six-year restoration
OL,15,Fproject.
OL,17,FThe site, the equivalent of 42 football
OL,18,Fpitches, is made up of wetlands,
OL,19,Fgrassland and coastal scrub.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
