OL,3,GNEWSAFormer golf course transformed
OL,4,Ainto nature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reserve would support species
OL,7,Fincluding lapwing, snipe and terns,
OL,8,Fwhile providing a vital stop-off for
OL,9,Fmigratory birds, the charity said.
